<h1 class="text-gotg">About the Foundation</h1>
<p class="lead">Gift of the Givers is the largest disaster-response organisation of African origin on the continent.</p>
<p>Founded on the principles of compassion, efficiency and resilience, the Foundation provides food, water,
   medical care, search-and-rescue and rebuilding support to communities affected by natural disasters and
   emergencies. This web application is a prototype built for Part 1 of the Portfolio of Evidence and
   demonstrates the look, feel and core functionality of the future system.</p>

<h4 class="text-gotg mt-4">What this prototype demonstrates</h4>
<ul>
    <li>Branded, responsive interface built with Bootstrap.</li>
    <li>Authentication with two roles &mdash; <strong>Employee</strong> and <strong>Donor</strong>.</li>
    <li>Donations (one-time or recurring) in ZAR, USD or EUR with a downloadable tax certificate.</li>
    <li>A volunteer registration form stored in a simple database table.</li>
    <li>An employee dashboard for posting project updates and viewing volunteer sign-ups.</li>
</ul>
